      "side": 0,
      "message": "Creating a separate tag allows us to flatten any logic in consuming functions that are based on struct-type. Off the top of my head, I can\u0027t think of any use cases for this right now (and I am not sure type assertions on depTags is necessarily better either)\n\nChanging the implementation to adding a field instead",
